How to Run build the docker:

$ docker build -t ros2-turtlebot3:v1.0 .

How to run the docker:

docker run -it --rm --privileged --net=host  --env=DISPLAY  --env=QT_X11_NO_MITSHM=1  -v /tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix  ros2-turtlebot3:v1.0

how to run another terminal:

docker exec -it <Find_Docker_Name> bash